before she goes on a European tour for bushwalking. On examination, she has a mini-mental status exam (MMSE)
score of 21/30. Which one of the following is the most appropriate action for you to take?',NULL,'B','As a rule, patients with dementia, regardless of the severity, should not travel alone. Even in its mildest form,
