daughters; therefore, the directives should be obtained from the wife. One other important step is trying to find out
whether the patient was competent or not when he expressed such wishes.
In instances where no advance health directive or a spouse, family members, or carer is present, a medical
superintendent or authorized medical officer can decide for life-saving emergency surgery if the patient is
incompetent to make a decision.
Application to Guardianship is required for all those patients who lack the capacity to decide about their treatment;
however it usually takes few days.
Under the Guardianship Act 1987, a ''person responsible'' can make decisions about most medical or dental
treatments.
A ''person responsible'' is, in order of priority:
(1) - The legally appointed guardian of the person (including enduring guardian) with the function of consenting to
medical/dental treatment
If there is not one then
(2) - Their spouse or de facto spouse or same sex partner, or if there is no spouse or de facto spouse or same sex
partner
If there is not one then
(3) - Their unpaid carer
If there is not one then
(4) - The patient’s nearest relative over the age of 18 year, which means (in order of preference):
Son or daughter',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-7f6d3537b7aa","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"577424f3a02ac3b1b41f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":477,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
