70% and 60% of patients, respectively. The patient can become quickly septic and hypotensive with altered level of consciousness.\n(Option A) Septic shock can result from acute cholangitis, and is a clinical syndrome not a diagnosis.\n(Option B) Choledocholithiasis is the presence of gallstones within the common bile duct. A patient with uncomplicated common bile duct stones typically develops abdominal pain with mild liver function abnormalities. Fever is not a usual fever in\nuncomplicated patients. The two major complications associated with choledocholithiasis are acute cholangitis and acute pancreatitis.\n(Option C) In acute pancreatitis, the abdominal pain is typically accompanied by nausea and vomiting, which may persist for many hours. The patient is often restless. Jaundice is not a feature unless there is concomitant common bile duct (CBD)\nobstruction and cholangitis.\n(Option D) Acute cholecystitis is inflammation of the gallbladder, characterized by right upper quadrant pain and tenderness, fever, and leukocytosis. Gallstones are the most common etiology. Jaundice is not a feature of acute cholecystitis.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"low","currentness_keywords":[],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"6b7673ad5243871e77a2b2919ec8d1bcae8b570e","duplicate_group_id":"exact-6b7673ad5243","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"b1ed7e364d258fb4e9f0","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":534,"source_qid":"649"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
