with EoE either by\nreducing acid production in patients with co-existent GERD, or by other unknown anti-inflammatory mechanisms.\nThe main three components of treatment in established EoE are (1) dietary advice and alteration, (2) pharmacotherapy, and (3) surgical intervention. For pharmacological\nintervention topical swallowed steroids (e.g., fluticasone, budesonide) are considered the main treatment options, once the diagnosis of EoE is established either after failed PPI\ntherapy or normal pH studies.\nFor patients unresponsive to the above measure, oral (systemic) predniso(lo)ne maybe indicated.\n(Option A) The condition is not infectious and antifungal or antimicrobial agents have no role in treatment.\n(Option C) Topical swallowed steroids (e.g., budesonide) are considered as the next step, once the diagnosis of EoE is established either after failed PPI therapy or normal pH\nstudies.\n(Option D) Systemic corticosteroids are a treatment option for patients unresponsive to PPIs or swallowed corticosteroids.\n(Option E) Eradication of H.pylori have not shown efficacy in treatment of EoE.\n \nTOPIC REVIEW","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","antimicrobial","asthma","guideline","management","therapy","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"6639d0258987d2a53cc576bc44eafac1de5fcd65","duplicate_group_id":"exact-6639d0258987","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"b227e283268af389d482","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":572,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
